summary:
  A country chip left by an earlier search keeps an empty answer empty.

history:
  Seen in the running widget on 2026-09-21: "jazz united states", then
  "virgin radio uk" answered "No matching stations" with the American chip
  still up. An inherited scope now steps aside when the new text finds
  nothing inside it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/SearchLogic.js

find:
      if (s.inheritedScope === true) return "unscope";

replace:
      if (s.inheritedScope === true) return "done";

expect:
  Killed by tst_searchlogic::test_an_inherited_country_chip_steps_aside_for_an_empty_answer.
  Line-neutral.
